    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like a \"natural part\" of anything. it feels like i've been lied to. everything i've done, every late night, every sacrifice... it was all for a ghost. if there's no meaning, then what's the point of even continuing the process? why keep moving just to reach the same nothingness?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
